[{"sha":"7d2d112dd07a03848225fd264855466496110724","node_id":"C_kwDOPm8esNoAKDdkMmQxMTJkZDA3YTAzODQ4MjI1ZmQyNjQ4NTU0NjY0OTYxMTA3MjQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mike Renwick","email":"mike.renwick@gmail.com","date":"2025-09-13T21:24:47Z"},"committer":{"name":"Mike Renwick","email":"mike.renwick@gmail.com","date":"2025-09-13T21:24:47Z"},"message":"feat: release v0.4.5 with enhanced token-based chunking and model optimization\n\nMajor enhancements to chunking precision and model utilization:\n\n- Implement token-aware chunking using HuggingFace tokenizers for precise sizing\n- Configure FastEmbed to use full model capacity (8K tokens for nomic/jina vs 512 default)\n- Add model-specific chunk configurations (1024 tokens for large models, 400 for small)\n- Streamline --inspect command with essential token analysis and clean visualization\n- Display model configuration and progress during indexing operations\n- Resolve all clippy warnings for CI compliance with -D warnings flag\n- Update documentation with crates.io availability and granular progress features\n\nTechnical improvements:\n- Replace character estimation with actual model tokenizers for precision\n- Balance chunk sizes for optimal precision vs context (avoiding 8K chunks that damage accuracy)\n- Enhanced progress bars with file-level and chunk-level feedback\n- Comprehensive quality checks with 88 passing tests\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f943b2eddfac6de19a71662c9b071895e2cb381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/git/trees/3f943b2eddfac6de19a71662c9b071895e2cb381"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/git/commits/7d2d112dd07a03848225fd264855466496110724","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/commits/7d2d112dd07a03848225fd264855466496110724","html_url":"ht